    # 2. Union-Find (Disjoint Set Union) - 0.3
    # 3. Kahn's algorithm for cycle detection in directed graphs (not applicable here) - 0.0
    # 4. Topological sorting with in-degree count (not applicable here) - 0.0
    # 5. Iterative DFS with visited and recursion stack - 0.4

    # Choose an algorithm based on the probabilities
    algo = random.choices([1, 2, 3, 4, 5], weights=[0.3, 0.3, 0.0, 0.0, 0.4])[0]

